EXT. DIAMOND DISTRICT - NIGHT

Andrea, concealed in the shadows of a fire escape, observes the bustling street below. Jewelry stores glitter under the streetlights, their displays tempting targets.  Hours pass.  Just as Andrea begins to doubt her hunch, a black van screeches to a halt outside a prominent jeweler.  Three masked figures jump out, armed with crowbars.

ANDREA
(Whispering into her comm)
This is it.  They're making their move.

The criminals smash the store window, triggering the alarm.  They begin frantically scooping up jewelry. Andrea leaps from the fire escape, landing silently behind them.

ANDREA
(Her voice calm and authoritative)
Drop your weapons.  GCPD!

The criminals whirl around, surprised. One lunges at Andrea with a crowbar. She disarms him swiftly, delivering a sharp kick to his chest. The other two hesitate, then decide to fight.  A brief but intense struggle ensues. Andrea, utilizing her superior combat skills, manages to subdue all three criminals.  Police sirens wail in the distance, growing closer.

ANDREA
(Contacting dispatch)
Suspects apprehended.  Requesting backup at my location.

===GAME END===
